Spatial dimensions: @COSMICTIGER_DIMENSION_COUNT@
CosmicTiger build targets

  cosmictiger       Build the application with the enabled capabilities.
  cosmictiger_help  Show this guide.

Enabled capabilities:
  PMMM gravity (FMM near field with PP fallback): @COSMICTIGER_ENABLE_GRAVITY@
  SPH: @COSMICTIGER_ENABLE_SPH@
  Equilibrium cooling: @COSMICTIGER_WITH_CHEMISTRY@ (requires SPH)
  Stars: @COSMICTIGER_WITH_STARS@ (COSMICTIGER_ENABLE_STARS; requires chemistry and SPH)
  ROCKSTAR halo and lightcone analysis: @COSMICTIGER_WITH_ROCKSTAR@ (COSMICTIGER_ENABLE_ROCKSTAR; requires gravity)
  Potential expansion degrees: @COSMICTIGER_EXPANSION_DEGREE@
  Particle positions: @COSMICTIGER_POSITION_TYPE@

Select the PMMM near field at runtime with gravity.method.near (fmm or its
pp fallback) and the integrator with run.timeIntegrator. Select a compiled
potential degree with gravity.expansionDegree. SPH hydrodynamics uses hydro.method=sph.
Run cosmictiger --help for details.
Star formation uses starFormation.enabled=true with hydro.enabled=true and
chemistry.enabled=true; see docs/star_formation.md for model assumptions.
  Integration: hierarchical gravity, split long/short kicks, midpoint SPH
